<title>BELARUS: Belarus Dec inflation leaps to 7.7 pct vs 3.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Belarus Dec inflation leaps to 7.7 pct vs 3.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>December inflation in Belarus leapt to 7.7 percent from 3.6 percent in November, the Statistics Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>BELARUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES</p>
<p>			 Dec 96    Nov 96   Dec 95</p>
<p>m/m pct change	+7.7	+3.6	+3.9</p>
<p>yr/yr pct change   +39.3     +34.0     +244.0</p>
<p>Former finance minister Pavel Dik forecasted before resigning earlier this month that inflation would reach 10 percent in January from a planned two percent, and he warned of &quot;strong inflationary expectations.&quot;</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
